.<\/p>"}},"stage_UQbKkJ":{"type":"stage","settings":{"label":"Late evening","heading":"Vanilla over beeswax","text":"<p>Powdery and soft, the part that stays on the pillow.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["stage_pF7h9K","stage_kMhrp4","stage_UQbKkJ"],"disabled":true,"name":"Apiarian Scent Flow","settings":{"eyebrow":"The notes","heading":"How <em>Brood<\/em>  unfolds.","intro_text":"<p>Beeswax binds the aromatic compounds of the oils and slows their evaporation, so the blend arrives in stages instead of all at once.<\/p>","bee_image_one":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/7bffe3d2-40c9-40c5-9c8a-2b0868e38207.png","heading_size":54,"section_background":"#fffcf6","eyebrow_color":"#8a6a1f","heading_color":"#21170f","body_color":"#2a2118","text_color":"#21170f","border_color":"#ded7cb","padding_top":70,"padding_bottom":70,"mobile_heading_size":39,"mobile_padding_top":45,"mobile_padding_bottom":45}},"pddp_notes_W3i8py":{"type":"pddp-notes","blocks":{"stage_zdnU39":{"type":"stage","settings":{"label":"First spray","heading":"Propolis","text":"<p>Sharp and green at first, the resin bees use to seal the hive.<\/p>"}},"stage_FVr6yt":{"type":"stage","settings":{"label":"An hour in","heading":"Labdanum","text":"<p>Sweet and leathery, it carries the middle of the blend.<\/p>"}},"stage_GnCKJK":{"type":"stage","settings":{"label":"Late evening","heading":"Benzoin over beeswax","text":"<p>Vanillic and slow, it holds on the fabric into the evening.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["stage_zdnU39","stage_FVr6yt","stage_GnCKJK"],"name":"pdp new flow","settings":{"eyebrow":"The notes","heading":"A fragrance that <em>moves through the evening.<\/em>","intro_text":"<p>Beeswax binds the aromatic compounds of the oils and slows their evaporation, so the blend arrives in stages instead of all at once.<\/p>","bee_image_three":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/7bffe3d2-40c9-40c5-9c8a-2b0868e38207_1.png","heading_size":54,"section_background":"#fffcf6","eyebrow_color":"#8a6a1f","heading_color":"#21170f","body_color":"#5c4b2e",